  "worked_solution": "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$\\land.$\"\n\nNote that the given sentence is a shortened version of the following full sentence:\n\n$8$ is a natural number and $8$ is divisible by $4.$\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n\\[\n\\underbrace{8 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is a natural number} }_P \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textrm{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{8 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is divisible by } 4}_Q,\n\\]\n\nthat is, $P \\land Q.$",
