  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-170736\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$\\land.$\"</p>\n<p>Note that the given sentence is a shortened version of the following full sentence:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>$8$ is a natural number and $8$ is divisible by $4.$</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So, the sentence reads</p>\n<p>\\[\n\\underbrace{8 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is a natural number} }_P \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textrm{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{8 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is divisible by } 4}_Q,\n\\]</p>\n<p>that is, $P \\land Q.$</p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">$P \\land P$</div></div>",
